Visit Cheri's Area!            NannyMUD Times                         Page 5


Have you visited Cheri's area? Do you think you know it? Well, perhaps you used
  to know it, but things have changed since it recently has been expanded to
  five times its original size and has lots more monsters and places to
  explore. The area is not particularly newbie-friendly since much of the
  interesting stuff is hidden, except in the house, where a newbie can gain
  experience from solving puzzles and not killing a thing. However, in much of
  the area it takes an intrepid explorer to examine everything to uncover all
  the secrets that the area has to offer.

There are animals for Hunters to kill, there are evil monsters for knights to
  kill, as well as other guilds whose rising ranks don't depend on alignment
  kills. It's not the best place for darks, although there are a few good kills
  for them, as well. The area really resonates to more seasoned players who
  know how to get around and root out hidden places that are not obvious to the
  naked eye.

One word of caution to knights: wait till after an attack to explore the area 
  until you know your way around and can get in and out easily.

So, intrepid explorers, get your armour and weapons ready and begin exploring
  this very large and spread out area. You'll find tons of things to kill and
  do here. Feedback welcome. :)  Happy Hunting!

Cheri~*
